/*
  BreadcrumbOverridesContext.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0166 · BreadcrumbOverridesContext (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web source
  (components/layout/BreadcrumbOverridesContext.tsx) is an anonymous, transparent coordination
  primitive — it carries no user-facing copy of its own (it only collects + merges per-route label
  overrides). The shipped entries here back the trail renderer's accessibility wording (the
  `<nav aria-label>` and the leading Home link, the native peer of the web `a11y.breadcrumb` /
  `a11y.breadcrumbHome` keys `<Breadcrumbs>` resolves). The remaining "sample" entries back the
  DEBUG-only inspector + route table used by the previews + the view-composition tests; they are never
  shipped. Production callers register their own already-localized labels via setBreadcrumbOverrides.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are
  kept in a per-surface table ("BreadcrumbOverridesContext") so each parallel surface prompt owns its
  own strings.
*/

